config BR2_PACKAGE_CADR_TOOLS
	bool "cadr-tools"
	help
	  The programs that run on the processing system beside the CADR,
	  built from the source directory beside this file.  Today:
	  cadr-pack-feeder, which serves the CADR's disk from the pack
	  file on the card, and the init script that mounts the card and
	  starts it.
